  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The height of a transmitting antenna at the top of a tower is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>25</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> and that of receiving antenna is, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>49</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>. The maximum distance between them, for satisfactory communication in LOS (Line-Of-Sight) is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>K</mi><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>. The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>K</mi></math> is _____ .</p><p>(Assume radius of Earth is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>64</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>) [Calculate upto nearest integer value]</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "192",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Here,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>49</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>64</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p><p>Maximum distance between two antennae is,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>R</mi><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>T</mi></msub></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>R</mi><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></msqrt><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>R</mi><mfenced><mn>49</mn></mfenced></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>R</mi><mfenced><mn>25</mn></mfenced></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>R</mi></msqrt><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>64</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>192</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/936c12b7-f2a1-4671-b6a7-a1b10c507f4f-image.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 91px;\" /></p>",
